      "body": "```\r\nIndex: settings/Controller/LogSettingsController.php\r\nIDEA additional info:\r\nSubsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP\r\n<+>UTF-8\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- settings/Controller/LogSettingsController.php\t(revision aa00b2b277e9b8d831b5381b9dc5a2cd92212182)\r\n+++ settings/Controller/LogSettingsController.php\t(date 1546116198000)\r\n@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@\r\n use OCP\\AppFramework\\Http\\StreamResponse;\r\n use OCP\\ILogger;\r\n use OCP\\IRequest;\r\n+use OCP\\IServerContainer;\r\n \r\n /**\r\n  * Class LogSettingsController\r\n@@ -42,9 +43,9 @@\r\n \t/** @var ILogger */\r\n \tprivate $log;\r\n \r\n-\tpublic function __construct(string $appName, IRequest $request, ILogger $logger) {\r\n+\tpublic function __construct(string $appName, IRequest $request, IServerContainer $c) {\r\n \t\tparent::__construct($appName, $request);\r\n-\t\t$this->log = $logger;\r\n+\t\t$this->log = $c->getLogger();\r\n \t}\r\n \r\n \t/**\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou may add `use OCP\\IServerContainer;` below `use OCP\\IRequest;`",
